{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"d8885e6a91fda69299baa831f2b2545a03400511aa0c6eddcb90212c28c032b7","ja":"物資争奪戦！","zh":"物资争夺战！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b2b4f4087150eefa4a0f88dac489215bce37f825e3142de1bf214766f997b7c0","ja":"ふたりとも、元気がモリモリ出る特製年越しそばに\n入れる食材は決まりましたか？","zh":"两位都决定好要在让人精力充沛的\n特制跨年荞麦面里加什么食材了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b196300de784f8e4f460c287d17450737086a16297f7d4bf79736fa2c8b6ba50","ja":"もっちろん♪　●●●●プロデューサーさんが\n泣いて喜ぶ食べ物を思いついたよ♪","zh":"当然啦♪ 我想到了能让●●●●制作人\n感动到哭出来的食物哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8785e1a09c1f25d7eca3f73093bba7d034294dad42f0bdac869b98122f8b4ce6","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーには健康でいてほしいからな！\nいっぱい元気が出るものを選んだぜ！","zh":"●●●●因为希望制作人能健健康康的嘛！\n所以我挑了好多能让人元气满满的东西哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c13e50a349e007186d01e1a3739cf7b2c1ef992bf3e6c3a9e69b21b92a79d7bc","ja":"バッチリみたいですね♪\nそれじゃあ、買い物しちゃいましょう！","zh":"看起来完全没问题呢♪\n那我们就去买东西吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e72ef0250a39e9c1c50dbe812cd483cd9db7d4a7fc5102333f72d3aa1532c399","ja":"意気込んだのはいいけど……さすが年末。\n人が多すぎて……あっ！","zh":"虽然干劲十足是挺好的……但真不愧是年末。\n人太多了……啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"1919e22f37b987f05cbb73d0778061694d4108c58c057d27b26afab1eb2c0e5f","ja":"まだ、あそこにお肉が！\n麗花さん、お願いします！","zh":"那里还有肉！\n丽花，拜托你了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a","ja":"はーい！","zh":"好——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a30cfad0da9315d20833b7d8b359eb17ffebf17c35a0edef9a0b6f12cacce4ad","ja":"……って、アレアレ？\nお肉が目の前から消えちゃった！","zh":"……不对，咦？\n肉从眼前消失了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"4a280dfe10b79ebe7bdaaee59c6ca76a6b3a83693288ae8ee8fc3ec578ffb151","ja":"ふぅ、やっと見つけた！\n美奈子と麗花は、買いたいものは買えたのか？","zh":"呼，终于找到了！\n美奈子和丽花买到想买的东西了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"8afe39e2051f6e80b127053a1d3bde36c1e9f5cc1fe193a1fdd2538577528d7d","ja":"私は全然……おそばと出汁と天ぷらは\n確保できたんだけど、特製の具材が……。","zh":"我这边完全没戏……虽然确保了\n荞麦面、高汤和天妇罗，但特制的食材却……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"577e1d96a8311b87a5f6e0e4adf420cfef59ed06e7906f2edee8dbfcb4def3d8","ja":"私も、お菓子はいっぱい買えたんだけど、\nお目当ての具材はさっぱり。","zh":"我也买了很多点心，\n但想找的食材却完全没找到。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"349064946e50be3e7dfed9ccf874319286ca4deaa9c7bc1a5054d550a0e6fc08","ja":"オレも目の前でうなぎが売り切れちゃってさー。\nこれだと、普通の年越しそばになっちゃうよな……。","zh":"我也在眼前被人把鳗鱼买空了呢——\n这样一来，就变成普通的跨年荞麦面了啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"745eb59ef74c99566987df531611b6496fe8eb8ec58f29114f4f1606fc120bab","ja":"そうだね、こうなったら……。","zh":"也是呢，既然都这样了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"e71efaf7166612bce39b3b81b3127595587b852c8a2a687cf2c1e7fed84ebeed","ja":"私たちに出来る努力と工夫で、\n新しい特製年越しそばを作りましょう！","zh":"靠我们力所能及的努力与巧思，\n来制作全新的特制跨年荞麦面吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"390c16abe16cc00758fa98df07b5fe1ed1d01bac90034cb1df5ba655f5c356a8","ja":"うん、それがいいね！　いざとなったら、\nお菓子のトッピングはいっぱいあるし♪","zh":"嗯，那样挺好的！真到了万一的时候，\n点心的配料也多得是呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1345.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"ab12ba64bbd40f95f8a43fbc58031e0bad992e597dc25608b801b3edea0d58c5","ja":"いやいや、いくら特製だからって、\nお菓子のトッピングはダメだろっ！","zh":"不对不对，就算再怎么说是特制的，\n也不能拿来当点心的配料吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
